  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">Meet your new travel essential—the Sullivan Pack leather crossbody bag. A refined take on the fanny pack, this Signature canvas and leather shoulder bag offers elevated style and functionality. Thanks to the adjustable strap on this messenger bag, you can switch how you wear it, depending on your outfit. Just choose left or right, and you’re good to go. Whether you&#x27;re traveling across the world or just trying to get across town, this bag can help make the journey just a little more stylish (and hands-free). Crafted of refined pebble leather, this small crossbody bag’s interior is surprisingly spacious, with plenty of room for your phone, credit cards, keys, and more. You can even fit a portable battery charger or use it as a camera bag for sightseeing adventures. Not only does its smart organization make it ideal for traveling, but it also makes a stylish mini crossbody bag for a night out.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Sullivan Pack In Blocked Signature Canvas</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Inside multifunction pocket</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">6.25&quot; (L) x 10.75&quot; (H) x 2.25&quot; (W)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
